# DISCLAIMER.md is required by thumos's legal status (research/educational software).
RELEASES/disclaimer-present:DISCLAIMER.md

# =============================================================================
# Workspace library crates — public API for the out-of-workspace kernel binary
# =============================================================================
#
# WHY(#126): The thumos kernel binary is excluded from the workspace (bare-metal
# target, separate Cargo.toml). The 12 workspace library crates below are the
# intended consumer-facing API surface — items declared `pub` are consumed by
# the binary and by external consumers via cargo publish. Narrowing to
# `pub(crate)` would trip clippy's dead-code detection for every non-internally-
# used item, because the workspace cannot see the binary's consumption. Once
# the binary imports these crates as path deps (#126 tracks that work), each
# crate's pub surface can be audited and narrowed per-item.
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/aither/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/asphaleia/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/eidolon/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/haphe/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/kelyphos/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/klesis/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/krypta/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/leipsanon/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/pteron/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/sema/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/stegnos/**
RUST/pub-visibility:crates/topos/**
